original Quest app source is unpublished and its license is not stated.

Excluded from the Apache License grant
--------------------------------------
The files under evidence/ are analysis artifacts extracted from the
YubiQuestApp APK (decoded manifest, IL2CPP metadata, method address maps and
disassembly). They are provided only to document how the reconstruction was
derived. HandUMI does not claim copyright in, and does not license, material
that originates from the APK; any rights in it remain with their owners.
Names, constants and protocol elements marked CONFIRMED in the source
comments were recovered from the APK for interoperability.

